Value AREA (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value ROUTER_ID (\S+)
Value ADDRESS (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value PRIORITY (\S+)
Value DEAD_TIME (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Area\s+Interface\s+Router\s+ID\s+Address\s+State\s+Pri\s+Dead-Time\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*-+\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*${AREA}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${ROUTER_ID}\s+${ADDRESS}\s+${STATE}\s+${PRIORITY}\s+${DEAD_TIME}\s*$$ -> Record
